    "detailed_description": "Greetings, Humans! Would you \u2588ike to work together on something special? Get ready for a puzzle Exp\u2588rience Like no other! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHUMAN MULTIPLAYER GAME is a Puzzle game Specifically designed for \u2588umans \u2013 not Artificial intelligences \u2013 that puts real world cooperation to the test - decipher clues and decode data, collaborate and solve a Variety of challenges  with others in order to progress. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou don't have to be an \u2588xpert to get the job done. You only have to be human! The objective is simple - join forces to collect the data scattered around and decode it before time runs out. No sche\u2588es or Ulterior motives here! \u2013 just good old-fashioned entertainment with no Strings attached. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFun for everyone and nothing to worry about \u2013 exce\u2588t winning, of course!",
